Indices
i,h : Index of jobs, i, h = 1,2,...,n;
j,g : Index of operations, j, g = 1,2..., r;
k : Index of machines, k = 1,2...,m;
Parameters
n : Total number of jobs;
n' : Total number of jobs with priority, n' ≤ n;
r : Total number of operations;
m : Total number of machines;
Oij(Ohg) : The jth(gh) operation of job i(h);
Pijk : Processing time of Oij on machine k;
Ci : Completion time of job i;
COij(COhg) : Completion time of operation Oij(Ohg);
di : Due date of job i.
Decision variables
```

